---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = "+17044696658";
const phoneDisplay = "+1 (704) 469-6658";
---
<Layout title="Thermostat Problems Gastonia NC | AC Not Responding | acrepairgastonianc.com" description="Thermostat issues in Gastonia: short-cycling, no response, wrong temperature. Often a fast fix. Call +1 (704) 469-6658.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/problems/">Problems</a> / Thermostat Issues</p>
      <h1>Thermostat Issues in Gastonia</h1>
      <p>Short-cycling, won't turn on, or ignores temperature settings — often a faulty thermostat and an inexpensive fix.</p>
      <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-white btn-lg">Call {phoneDisplay}</a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <p><span class="badge badge-warn">Address Soon</span></p>
      <p>A system that short-cycles, won't turn on, or ignores temperature settings often has a faulty thermostat — or wiring/power issues that look like a thermostat problem. We diagnose the control circuit accurately so you don't replace a good thermostat or miss a larger issue.</p>
      <p>Repair or upgrade (including programmable and smart thermostats) is frequently completed in a single visit. See <a href="/services/thermostat-repair/">Thermostat Repair</a>.</p>
      <div class="cta-box">
        <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Call {phoneDisplay}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
